# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, which rewrites line endings on
# checkout. Two places that must not happen:

# A shell script with CRLF fails at its shebang ("\r: command not found") on
# every POSIX shell, including the git-bash this repo is driven from.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Belt and braces. Git already detects these as binary; saying so means a
# future .gitattributes rule can never sweep them into text conversion and
# corrupt an icon.
*.png binary
